@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
title Sequence — Создание заметки (синхронно + асинхронно)

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Note Handler" as API
participant "Note Service" as Service
participant "Note Repository" as Repo
participant "Graph Outbox (таблица)" as EventBus
participant "Asynq Queue" as Queue
participant "NLP Client" as NLP
participant "Asynq Worker" as Worker

' === СИНХРОННАЯ ЧАСТЬ ===
' Примечание: Command/Query Bus в коде нет — хэндлер напрямую
' вызывает application-сервис (notehandler → application/note).
User -> FE : заполняет форму
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/notes
activate API

API -> Service : CreateNote(title, content, ...)
activate Service

Service -> Service : валидация (Value Objects)

Service -> Repo : Save(note)
activate Repo
note right: декоратор outbox в той же транзакции\nпишет строку graph_outbox (SYNC-1 A2);\nрелей в worker сливает её в graph:events
Repo -> EventBus : INSERT graph_outbox (NoteCreated)
EventBus --> Repo : ok
Repo --> Service : ok
deactivate Repo

' Асинхронные вызовы (не блокируют ответ)
Service ->> Queue : EnqueueExtractKeywords(noteID, 10)
activate Queue
Queue --> Service : ok
deactivate Queue

Service ->> Queue : EnqueueComputeEmbedding(noteID)
Service ->> Queue : EnqueueNormalizeNote(noteID)
Service ->> Queue : EnqueueRecalculateLinkWeights(noteID, delay)
Service ->> Queue : EnqueueRefreshRecommendations(noteID, delay)
Queue --> Service : ok

Service --> API : note
deactivate Service
API --> FE : 201 Created
deactivate API
FE --> User : отобразить заметку

' === АСИНХРОННАЯ ФОНОВАЯ ОБРАБОТКА ===

Queue ->> Worker : extract:keywords
activate Worker
Worker -> NLP : extract keywords (HTTP)
Worker -> Repo : сохранить note_keywords
deactivate Worker

Queue ->> Worker : compute:embedding
activate Worker
Worker -> NLP : POST /embed (синхронно)
activate NLP
NLP --> Worker : embedding
deactivate NLP
Worker -> Repo : сохранить note_embeddings
deactivate Worker

Queue ->> Worker : nlp:normalize / links:recalculate_weights / recommendation:refresh
activate Worker
Worker -> Repo : пересчёт весов / note_recommendations
deactivate Worker
@enduml